{
  "$comment": "The nightly all-drivers sweep (android-nightly-drivers.yml): every instrumentation driver under android/app/src/androidTest/kotlin/app/zen/chromium, the shard (one emulator boot) it runs on and the environment its own workflow gives it. android-nightly-drivers.mjs reads it (the matrix, the plan, the table) and android-nightly-drivers.test.mjs asserts every concrete *Demo class is either a driver here or in `skip` with a reason. Fields: id (its directory in the artifact), class / classes (the *Demo classes it covers), shard, mirrors (the workflow file[:job or input] whose environment it takes), dir (DEMO_DIR, the handshake directory), script (a wrapper instead of android-gesture-demo.sh), out (where a script with a fixed output path leaves its findings, moved into the artifact), env (script-env lines), setup (named steps the shard runs before the emulator: see the runner), needs (pin, browser-role, navigation: state the runner sets or puts back), timeout (seconds for the driver, 720 by default), estimate (minutes, for the plan), note.",
  "shards": {
